        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Bumaeng nthanmei tikei lou o",
            "Kaipou Jisu zan khou,",
            "Aniu lung khou hei tingsaengzaeng na",
            "Maikum na ti chuang lou o.",
            "",
            "Penticost nung tei meiguai nakhou",
            "Bumaeng Thanmei tikei;",
            "Kaniu rukhou kei lou pui gankhou",
            "Zaat guay lat thai ngam khuan e.",
            "",
            "2. Hei tei kumna mei guaina khang hei",
            "Bumaeng Thanmei panrui",
            "Aniu lung hei guang bam lou o;",
            "Tingkao latguai thai ngam khang,",
            "",
            "3. Ram kaguaina ntang khuan sini",
            "Mi lat kaeng hei nai e;",
            "Pap guay kuak louna ringmei lakhang",
            "Bumaeng Thanmei keilou o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
